# Optional Vision AI API configuration for HoloHand-Gesture-Agent-3D
# By default, HoloHand runs 100% locally in your browser using MediaPipe with zero API keys required.
# If you wish to enable advanced cloud multimodal vision classification for complex objects, configure below:

# Google Gemini API key (optional)
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Custom Vision API REST Endpoint (optional)
# VITE_VISION_API_URL=https://your-custom-vision-api.example.com/v1/detect
